0,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair way to handle the shortage. I'll look into the five years of association minutes and last year's complaint log entries to see how we got here.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to know if things are actually unfair! I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders, and also the five years of association minutes.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I'll check the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows to understand the physical situation.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station. It's about time we saw the actual numbers involved.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll examine the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary to see how these things are managed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Does anyone else think we should check the complaint log? I'm worried people are upset, but Asuka already has that covered. I'm just hoping the sticker register shows us who really needs the space!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The physical layout is the root of the friction. If the rain exposure is as bad as I suspect, some spots are naturally less desirable than others.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, your focus on the rain is quaint, but desirability doesn't pay the bills. I'm more interested in whether the ward park is a viable alternative for those we can't accommodate.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Whether it's viable or not depends on who is managing the transition. I want to see if the neighboring block's experience warns us about the administrative burden.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Administrative burden is a valid point, @Toshio, but we can't ignore the history of the building. If the minutes show a pattern of neglect, we need to address that first.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I just want everyone to be happy! If we find out that some people are using more than their fair share, maybe they'll be open to a new system.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Fairness isn't just about the number of bikes, @Yumi. It's about the daily struggle of getting them out. If the morning rush is a mess, no amount of stickers will fix the frustration.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, you're focusing on the symptoms. I'm looking for the systemic cause. If the building is broke, we can't just buy our way out of a ""shoving match.""","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. Financials are one thing, but the human cost of administration is another. I'm curious if a ""systemic"" fix just creates a new set of chores for someone to ignore.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we all have different priorities, but we've covered the history, the physical space, the money, and the management. Let's proceed with these choices and see what the data tells us.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm excited to see what we find! I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone smile and gets the bike area organized.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll be interested to see if the morning observations confirm my suspicions about the congestion. Let's get the facts first.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's hope the facts are actually documented for once. I'll be waiting to see if the numbers support any of your theories.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. Let's see if the records are as reliable as we hope, or if they're as empty as the parking spaces.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
